TROE shared data
================

/share contains immutable, architecture-independent data shipped with TROE.
Each producer owns a directory named /share/<producer> so examples, templates,
schemas, themes, and similar assets remain easy to find and cannot collide.

Executables belong in /bin, persistent or mounted data in /vol, and future
native shared libraries in /lib. Recovery-only bootstrap files live under
/recovery. The package-managed namespace uses writable desired configuration
in /config and exposes the active generation's resolved, non-secret
configuration read-only in /sys/config; /etc is absent and is not an alias.
